From 178bb0be393148e00c612f0d22f4f471df0a813a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akash Srivastava <akashniki@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:11:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ishtar: add ishtarPkg (Xiaomi 13 Ultra, SM8550-AB) from
 shengPkg

Board-level copy of shengPkg with sheng's board drivers reused by path
(key input, boot memory, GOP log, display depex), ISHTAR_VENDOR_HW = 0,
framebuffer 1440x3200, vendor binaries from Binaries/nuwa (the Kailua UEFI
build ishtar ships, with its panel M1 42 02 0a), and the second DRAM bank
for ishtar's 12 GB layout. Boot image config from nuwa (header v1).
